  brush.noStroke();

  // Batch 1: Flat wash of muted olive ochre shifted by (OX, OY)
  // Leaves a gleaming sliver of raw paper along the bottom sole/welt & front nose,
  // while extending beyond the black key stone along the top of toe, instep, and shaft!
